rooms_desc ({"You are standing in the big, wide open entrance hall of Mr. Bean's house.A warm and friendly light spreads all over the place. It makes you feel cosy.As you look around you find a coat reck, which invites you to hang your coatthere as well. Remember you are in a house, which is Mr. Bean's home.In the umbrella stand you can put your umbrella.In the south west corner of the hall you find an armour booth.As you know Mr. Bean doesn't like armour that much, so if you pay him a visit don't forget to leave your armour there and take it with you onyour way out.Mr. Bean wishes you a pleasent stay...........",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
